 Not sure it got it.":"c-be774dc819","Why was the laptop cold? It left its Windows open.":"c-22285a3d8b","Anytime!":"c-1332032e1c","Of course! What's next?":"c-6e450b5423","Aww, stop it. You're making my orb glow.":"c-9a93295e6e","You're pretty great yourself.":"c-e0c8906692","Hey, that tickles!":"c-779222cb91","Hi! I'm right here. What are we doing?":"c-538ffbca12","Mhm? Go ahead, I'm listening.":"c-a466e17ec2","Still here. Tap one of the ideas below and I'll show you how I think.":"c-b28c7566ed","You found my favorite spot.":"c-787afcd7ce","Boop right back at you.":"c-2310fe35fa","Hmm, that one needs your actual screen, and from inside a web page I can't see it. On your PC I'd just take a look and get it done. Want to try something I can show you here, like planning your week?":"c-b4194e4e77","Ooh, I like that. On your PC I'd handle it right there on your screen. In here I'm only the talking part, but ask me to explain something or draft an email and I'll show you how I think.":"c-0db80e6517","Good one. Honestly, that's exactly what I'm best at on your PC, where I can see what you see. Here, try me on a math problem or a reminder instead.":"c-949a6a6b91","Sure! What should I remind you about, and when?":"c-ec39644580"}